# Challenges

Common challenges include:

* Newly registered phishing domains.
* Homograph (Unicode) attacks.
* Short-lived scam websites.
* AI-generated branding and content.
* Fake social media accounts.
* False positives.

---

# Best Practices

* Investigate only publicly available information.
* Verify domains before trusting them.
* Cross-check official social media accounts.
* Never interact with suspicious websites or submit credentials.
* Follow responsible disclosure when appropriate.
* Focus on defensive cybersecurity and user protection.

